  "site": {
    "about_blocks": [
      {
        "h": "定位",
        "paras": [
          "工具站 HOT 是给工具爱好者看的发现站，每天从各个源中发现最新工具网站，帮你快速找到好用的 AI 工具、开发工具、设计工具与效率工具。",
          "我们只收点开就能用的工具网站：汇率计算器、格式转换、图片处理、代码工具……文章、新闻、博客、帖子一律不收。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "h": "怎么做",
        "paras": [
          "采集——公开 RSS 信源，每半小时拉一次；链接解析到工具本身，只收能直接用的工具站。",
          "打分——规则打分（时效、相关度、来源），不是 AI 打分。",
          "出报——只展示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "h": "制作人",
        "paras": [
          "Staroltest（Darin Petrov）。"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "about_blocks_en": [
      {
        "h": "What it is",
        "paras": [
          "Tool Site HOT is a discovery site for tool lovers. Every day it finds the newest tool websites from sources everywhere, helping you quickly find useful AI tools, developer tools, design tools and productivity tools.",
          "We only list tool websites you can open and use right away — converters, formatters, image tools, code tools and more. No articles, no news, no blog posts, no forum threads."
        ]
      },
      {
        "h": "How it works",
        "paras": [
          "Collect — public RSS sources, fetched every 30 minutes; links are resolved to the tool itself, and only usable tool sites are listed.",
          "Score — rule-based scoring (recency, relevance, source), not AI scoring.",
          "Publish — only titles, one-line summaries and links to the originals, no full text republished."
        ]
      },
      {
        "h": "Made by",
        "paras": [
          "Staroltest (Darin Petrov)."
        ]
      }
    ],
